    "title": "Research Associate Trainee \u2013 Computer Science Academic Writer",
    "type": "JOB",
    "location": "Coimbatore, India",
    "experience_min": 0,
    "experience_max": 1,
    "experience_label": "Fresher (0-1 yrs)",
    "stipend_or_salary": "\u20b915,000 - 25,000 / month",
    "description": "**Research Associate Trainee \u2013 Computer Science Academic Writer**\n\n**Location:** Gandhipuram, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu\n\n**Work Mode:** Full-Time | In-Office Only\n\n**Salary**\n\n**Training Period:** \u20b910,000 per month\n\n**After Confirmation:** \u20b915,000 per month\n\n**About the Role**\n\nWe are looking for enthusiastic **Research Associate Trainees** who are interested in building a career in academic research, technical writing, and Computer Science research.\n\nThis is a structured training role where you will learn how research papers, literature reviews, technical reports, and thesis documents are prepared for international journals and conferences.\n\nYou will work under the guidance of experienced researchers and gradually take ownership of research support activities as your skills develop.\n\n**Research Domains**\n\nYou will gain exposure to projects in one or more of the following areas:\n\n* Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning\n* Data Science & Analytics\n* Computer Vision & Image Processing\n* Cybersecurity\n* Computer Networks\n* Internet of Things (IoT)\n* General Computer Science Research\n\n**Training & Responsibilities**\n\nDuring your training period, you will learn to:\n\n* Search and analyze recent research papers\n* Conduct literature reviews and summarize research findings\n* Organize references and citations using IEEE and other academic formats\n* Format research papers, theses, and technical documents\n* Prepare comparison tables and research summaries\n* Assist in manuscript preparation and documentation\n* Support senior researchers with publication-related activities\n* Improve technical writing and academic English\n* Learn the research publication process from idea to submission\n\nResponsibilities will gradually increase based on your learning progress and performance.\n\n**A Typical Day in This Role**\n\nYou may spend your day:\n\n* Reading and summarizing research papers\n* Preparing literature review tables\n* Formatting research manuscripts\n* Organizing references and citations\n* Assisting with technical documentation\n* Supporting senior researchers in ongoing projects\n\n**Education**\n\n* Only Engineering Graduates: B.E. / B.Tech (Computer Science, Information Technology, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, Electronics & Communication, or related disciplines)\n\n**Experience**\n\n* Freshers are encouraged to apply.\n* Candidates with up to 1 year of experience in research writing, technical writing, thesis documentation, or academic projects may also apply.\n\n**Preferred Skills**\n\n* Good written and reading skills in English\n* Basic understanding of Computer Science concepts\n* Strong analytical and logical thinking\n* Attention to detail\n* Good knowledge of Microsoft Word\n* Interest in research and technical documentation\n* Willingness to learn new concepts and work in a research-oriented environment\n\n**Why Join Us?**\n\n* Hands-on training in academic research and technical writing\n* Exposure to real-world AI and Computer Science research projects\n* Structured mentorship from experienced researchers\n* Opportunity to contribute to research publications\n* Collaborative and learning-focused work environment\n* Long-term career growth opportunities\n\n**Career Path**\n\nResearch Associate Trainee\n\n\u2193\n\nResearch Associate\n\n\u2193\n\nTechnical Research Engineer\n\n\u2193\n\nSenior Technical Research Engineer\n\n\u2193\n\nResearch Team Lead\n\n**Selection Process**\n\n**Round 1:** Technical & English Writing Assessment\n\n**Round 2:** Face-to-Face Interview (Mandatory)\n\n**Important Hiring Policy**\n\n* This is a full-time, in-office position based in Gandhipuram, Coimbatore.\n* Candidates should be comfortable commuting or relocating before joining.\n* Timely communication throughout the recruitment process is expected.\n* Candidates who miss interviews without prior notice or repeatedly fail to respond to communication may not be considered for future openings.\n* Please read the job post clearly and apply only if you are genuinely interested in attending the interview and joining if selected.\n* Selected candidates must work a minimum of 1 year.\n\n**How to Apply**\n\n**Apply here in Indeed or Email your resume to:**\n\n**softscholarshrd@gmail.com**\n\n**Walk-In Interview:**  \nThursdays | Strictly 10:00 AM \u2013 1:00 PM  \nGandhipuram, Coimbatore\n\nLocation: https://maps.app.goo.gl/BStgnS9pvjUdys6A8\n\nJob Types: Full-time, Permanent, Fresher\n\nPay: \u20b915,000.00 - \u20b925,000.00 per month\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Flexible schedule\n\nAbility to commute/relocate:\n\n* Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu: Reliably commute or planning to relocate before starting work (Required)\n\nApplication Question(s):\n\n* We are looking for long-time candidates. Will you work more than 1 year in this company?\n\nEducation:\n\n* Bachelor's (Required)\n\nLanguage:\n\n* Tamil (Required)\n\nWork Location: In person",
